  "details": "With the “Freeze Trackers on Disconnect” feature, when a tracker freezes it may be difficult for users to notice their tracker is drifting.  Previously when a tracker would drift, the tracker would fly away, being very noticeable that it was having difficulty being seen.  An opt in HUD element that only appears when a tracker losing tracking or something similar to that may be nice to have to avoid situations where you lose tracking without realizing.",
